       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-OCE-ELAST.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-OCE-ELAST-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DOPPLER-TRACK-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAYLEIGH-VEL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COHERENCE-GATE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OCE-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OCE-SEAL-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-OCE-ELAST-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-POC-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-POC-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DOPPLER-AND-VEL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-GATE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-POC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DOPPLER-AND-VEL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DOPPLER-TRACK-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RAYLEIGH-VEL-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-GATE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COHERENCE-GATE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OCE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-POC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DOPPLER-TRACK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RAYLEIGH-VEL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COHERENCE-GATE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-OCE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-OCE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-POC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-POC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-POC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-POC-CODE.
